/P 78 0 R
/E (The working of the fire alarm system is based on the detection of infrared \(IR\) radiation emitted by flames and the processing of this signal using the Arduino Uno. When combustion occurs, the flame produces infrared radiation in the wavelength range of approximately 760 nm to 1100 nm. The IR flame sensor is designed to sense this radiation and convert it into an electrical signal.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
