<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (Arduino Uno is the main control unit of the fire alarm system. It is based on the ATmega328P microcontroller and operates at 5V. The board consists of 14 digital input/output pins and 6 analog input pins. In this project, the Arduino reads the digital signal from the IR flame sensor and processes it according to the program uploaded into it. When the sensor detects flame, the Arduino activates the buzzer and LED to give an alert. Thus, it acts as the brain of the entire system.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
