<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (The buzzer is used as an audible alarm indicator. It produces sound when it receives a HIGH signal from the Arduino. In this fire alarm system, when the flame sensor detects fire, the Arduino sends a signal to the buzzer, causing it to emit a loud sound. This alerts people nearby about the presence of fire.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
